// Kesh of the Glass Dunes — a champion of the Proving Circle. The player's
// own art (`base`), in sun-bleached sand: a rival is an avatar like the
// player, so it animates through the same selector and needs every clip the
// player has, which building on the player's set gives it for nothing.
ClipSet(
    base: "player",
    tint: (255, 214, 150),
    clips: {},
)
